[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
faro is a linked device, like Signal Desktop: your phone stays
your primary device.

Quick start:
  faro demo   try it first with a fake account (nothing is sent)
  faro link   scan the QR code in Signal > Settings > Linked devices
  faro        run it

Your messages and keys live in ~/.local/share/faro/, and the
config file is ~/.config/faro/config.toml (written on first run).

Press F1 inside faro for every key, or search them in the command
palette (Ctrl+P). To quit, press Ctrl+Q.
EOM
}
]
